{"seq":1,"slug":"ipc-communication-patterns","title":"IPC 通信设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/electron-desktop/development/ipc-communication-patterns","wordCount":790,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"ipc-通信设计模式\">IPC 通信设计模式</h1><p>Electron 应用的主进程与渲染进程运行在不同的操作系统进程中，它们之间的每一次交互都必须通过 IPC（Inter-Process Communication）管道完成。IPC 设计的质量直接决定了应用的安全性、可维护性和类型安全性。2026 年的 Electron 最佳实践已从早期的 <code>send/on</code> 模式全面转向 <code>invoke/handle</code> 模式，配合 <code>contextBridge</code> 的最小暴露原则和 TypeScript 类型推导，形成完整的类型安全 IPC 架构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant R as 渲染进程&#10;    participant P as Preload 脚本&#10;    participant M as 主进程&#10;&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;P: window.electronAPI.readFile(path)&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;M: ipcRenderer.invoke(&#39;file:read&#39;, path)&#10;    M-&gt;&gt;M: 验证输入 + 执行操作&#10;    M--&gt;&gt;P: 返回结果 / 抛出错误&#10;    P--&gt;&gt;R: Promise resolve / reject\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant R as 渲染进程\n    participant P as Preload 脚本\n    participant M as 主进程\n\n    R-&gt;&gt;P: window.electronAPI.readFile(path)\n    P-&gt;&gt;M: ipcRenderer.invoke('file:read', path)\n    M-&gt;&gt;M: 验证输入 + 执行操作\n    M--&gt;&gt;P: 返回结果 / 抛出错误\n    P--&gt;&gt;R: Promise resolve / reject</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通信模式</th>\n<th>API 组合</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>错误传播</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>请求-响应</td>\n<td>invoke / handle</td>\n<td>绝大多数场景（CRUD、查询）</td>\n<td>自动（Error.message 序列化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单向推送（渲染→主）</td>\n<td>send / on</td>\n<td>日志上报、非关键事件</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单向推送（主→渲染）</td>\n<td>webContents.send / on</td>\n<td>状态广播、进度通知</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双向流</td>\n<td>MessagePort</td>\n<td>高频数据流、渲染进程间直连</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"invoke-handle-模式详解\">invoke/handle 模式详解</h2><p><code>ipcRenderer.invoke()</code> + <code>ipcMain.handle()</code> 是 Electron 推荐的主力通信模式。它具有 Promise 语义——渲染进程发起请求后获得一个 Promise，主进程 handler 的返回值或抛出的异常会自动传播回渲染进程。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// main.ts - 注册 handler&#10;import { ipcMain } from &#39;electron&#39;;&#10;import { z } from &#39;zod&#39;;&#10;&#10;const ReadFileSchema = z.object({&#10;  path: z.string().max(500),&#10;  encoding: z.enum([&#39;utf-8&#39;, &#39;binary&#39;]).default(&#39;utf-8&#39;),&#10;});&#10;&#10;ipcMain.handle(&#39;file:read&#39;, async (_event, rawInput: unknown) =&gt; {&#10;  const input = ReadFileSchema.parse(rawInput);&#10;&#10;  // 安全校验：阻止路径遍历&#10;  const resolved = path.resolve(input.path);&#10;  if (!resolved.startsWith(ALLOWED_ROOT)) {&#10;    throw new Error(&#39;路径访问被拒绝&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const content = await fs.readFile(resolved, input.encoding);&#10;  return { content, size: (await fs.stat(resolved)).size };&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// main.ts - 注册 handler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ipcMain } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'electron'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { z } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'zod'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ReadFileSchema</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  path: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  encoding: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'utf-8'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'binary'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'utf-8'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ipcMain.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'file:read'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rawInput</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ReadFileSchema.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rawInput);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 安全校验：阻止路径遍历</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> resolved</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input.path);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">resolved.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startsWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ALLOWED_ROOT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'路径访问被拒绝'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">readFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(resolved, input.encoding);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { content, size: (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(resolved)).size };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键设计原则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>每个 channel 对应一个语义动作</strong>——不要暴露通用的 <code>send(&#39;ipc&#39;, { type, payload })</code> 万能通道</li>\n<li><strong>在 handler 中校验所有输入</strong>——渲染进程发来的数据永远不可信</li>\n<li><strong>handler 应是无副作用或幂等的</strong>——便于重试和测试</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"contextbridge-安全暴露\">contextBridge 安全暴露</h2><p><code>contextBridge.exposeInMainWorld()</code> 是渲染进程与 IPC 系统之间的唯一合法桥梁。它的核心安全保证是：网页代码永远拿不到 <code>ipcRenderer</code> 对象本身，只能调用开发者显式暴露的白名单函数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// preload.ts - 最小暴露原则&#10;import { contextBridge, ipcRenderer } from &#39;electron&#39;;&#10;&#10;contextBridge.exposeInMainWorld(&#39;electronAPI&#39;, {&#10;  // 每个方法都是对一个 IPC channel 的封装&#10;  readFile: (path: string) =&gt; ipcRenderer.invoke(&#39;file:read&#39;, { path }),&#10;  saveFile: (path: string, content: string) =&gt; ipcRenderer.invoke(&#39;file:save&#39;, { path, content }),&#10;&#10;  // 从主进程接收推送的订阅模式&#10;  onProgressUpdate: (callback: (progress: number) =&gt; void) =&gt; {&#10;    const handler = (_event: unknown, value: number) =&gt; callback(value);&#10;    ipcRenderer.on(&#39;progress:update&#39;, handler);&#10;    return () =&gt; ipcRenderer.removeListener(&#39;progress:update&#39;, handler);&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// preload.ts - 最小暴露原则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { contextBridge, ipcRenderer } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'electron'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">contextBridge.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exposeInMainWorld</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'electronAPI'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 每个方法都是对一个 IPC channel 的封装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  readFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ipcRenderer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">invoke</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'file:read'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { path }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  saveFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ipcRenderer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">invoke</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'file:save'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { path, content }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 从主进程接收推送的订阅模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onProgressUpdate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">callback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">progress</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> callback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ipcRenderer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'progress:update'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, handler);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ipcRenderer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">removeListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'progress:update'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, handler);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>反模式警告——以下写法绝对禁止：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 绝对禁止：直接暴露 ipcRenderer&#10;contextBridge.exposeInMainWorld(&#39;ipc&#39;, ipcRenderer); // 攻击者可调用任意 channel&#10;contextBridge.exposeInMainWorld(&#39;ipc&#39;, {&#10;  send: ipcRenderer.send, // 同样危险：无参数过滤&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 绝对禁止：直接暴露 ipcRenderer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">contextBridge.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exposeInMainWorld</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ipc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ipcRenderer); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 攻击者可调用任意 channel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">contextBridge.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exposeInMainWorld</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ipc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  send: ipcRenderer.send, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 同样危险：无参数过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"typescript-类型安全架构\">TypeScript 类型安全架构</h2><p>大型 Electron 应用通常有数十个 IPC channel，手动维护渲染进程的类型声明极易出错。推荐使用集中式 Schema 定义 + 类型推导的方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// shared/ipc-schema.ts - 单一真相源&#10;export type IpcChannelMap = {&#10;  &#39;file:read&#39;: {&#10;    args: [{ path: string; encoding?: string }];&#10;    return: { content: string; size: number };&#10;  };&#10;  &#39;file:save&#39;: {&#10;    args: [{ path: string; content: string }];&#10;    return: { success: boolean };&#10;  };&#10;  &#39;app:version&#39;: {&#10;    args: [];&#10;    return: string;&#10;  };&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 渲染进程类型声明 - interface.d.ts&#10;type ExposedAPI = {&#10;  [K in keyof IpcChannelMap]: (...args: IpcChannelMap[K][&#39;args&#39;]) =&gt; Promise&lt;IpcChannelMap[K][&#39;return&#39;]&gt;;&#10;};&#10;&#10;declare global {&#10;  interface Window {&#10;    electronAPI: ExposedAPI;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// shared/ipc-schema.ts - 单一真相源</span></span>\n<span c