ass=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'file:save'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">success</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'app:version'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 渲染进程类型声明 - interface.d.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExposedAPI</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> keyof</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IpcChannelMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IpcChannelMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'args'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">IpcChannelMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'return'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">declare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> global {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    electronAPI</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExposedAPI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种方式确保修改 IPC schema 时，类型错误会在编译期被捕获，而不是在运行时以隐晦的序列化错误表现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主进程向渲染进程推送\">主进程向渲染进程推送</h2><p>某些场景需要主进程主动向渲染进程推送消息（如下载进度、系统事件通知）。使用 <code>webContents.send()</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// main.ts - 主进程推送&#10;function notifyProgress(win: BrowserWindow, progress: number) {&#10;  win.webContents.send(&#39;progress:update&#39;, progress);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// preload.ts 中已暴露 onProgressUpdate 订阅方法（见上文）&#10;&#10;// renderer.tsx - React 组件中使用&#10;useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;  const unsubscribe = window.electronAPI.onProgressUpdate((progress) =&gt; {&#10;    setProgress(progress);&#10;  });&#10;  return unsubscribe; // 组件卸载时取消订阅&#10;}, []);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// main.ts - 主进程推送</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> notifyProgress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">win</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BrowserWindow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">progress</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  win.webContents.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'progress:update'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, progress);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// preload.ts 中已暴露 onProgressUpdate 订阅方法（见上文）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// renderer.tsx - React 组件中使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">useEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unsubscribe</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window.electronAPI.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onProgressUpdate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">progress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    setProgress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(progress);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unsubscribe; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 组件卸载时取消订阅</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}, []);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"messageport-直连通道\">MessagePort 直连通道</h2><p>当两个渲染进程需要高频通信（如协同编辑的实时同步），通过主进程中转的延迟不可接受。此时可用 <code>MessagePort</code> 建立点对点通道：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// main.ts - 创建并分发 port&#10;const { port1, port2 } = new MessageChannelMain();&#10;win1.webContents.postMessage(&#39;new-port&#39;, null, [port1]);&#10;win2.webContents.postMessage(&#39;new-port&#39;, null, [port2]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// main.ts - 创建并分发 port</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">port1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">port2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MessageChannelMain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">win1.webContents.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">postMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'new-port'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [port1]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">win2.webContents.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">postMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'new-port'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [port2]);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>初始的 port 传递仍经过主进程，但建立连接后，两个渲染进程可直接通信，不再经过主进程中转。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>invoke/handle</code> 是主力模式：Promise 语义、自动错误传播、适合绝大多数场景</li>\n<li><code>contextBridge</code> 只暴露白名单函数，永远不暴露 <code>ipcRenderer</code> 本身</li>\n<li>集中式 IPC Schema + TypeScript 类型推导确保编译期类型安全</li>\n<li>主进程推送用 <code>webContents.send()</code>，渲染进程间直连用 <code>MessagePort</code></li>\n<li>每个 handler 都必须校验输入、验证权限——渲染进程永远不可信</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../foundations/security-architecture\">安全架构三支柱</a>——contextBridge 的安全原理与隔离机制</li>\n<li><a href=\"/hubs/frontend/frontend-security-engineering/injection/xss\">前端 XSS 攻击与防御</a>——理解为什么渲染进程输入永远不可信</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"IPC 通信设计模式","id":"ipc-通信设计模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"invoke/handle 模式详解","id":"invoke-handle-模式详解"},{"level":2,"text":"contextBridge 安全暴露","id":"contextbridge-安全暴露"},{"level":2,"text":"TypeScript 类型安全架构","id":"typescript-类型安全架构"},{"level":2,"text":"主进程向渲染进程推送","id":"主进程向渲染进程推送"},{"level":2,"text":"MessagePort 直连通道","id":"messageport-直连通道"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Electron 版本演进与技术栈对齐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/electron-desktop/foundations/version-evolution"},"next":{"title":"BrowserWindow 窗口管理与多窗口架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/electron-desktop/development/window-management"}}